      "doc": "Limits the token enforces on attestations. Two of them bound a compromised attestor\\nkey in time, not just per step: `min_interval_secs` is measured on the ledger clock\\n(attestor-supplied timestamps cannot consume it) and `max_daily_rate_change_bps` caps\\nthe total move inside any rolling `RATE_BUDGET_WINDOW_SECS` window against the rate the\\nwindow opened with.",
